@startuml
title D-08 Assisted Payment Terminal Context and Modes
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Cashier" as Cashier
actor "Parker" as Parker
actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor

rectangle "Assisted Payment Terminal App Family" {
  component "Cashier-Assisted Terminal Mode\nnormal assisted payment" as CashierMode
  component "Continuity Terminal Mode\nrestricted degraded / BCP" as ContinuityMode
  component "Terminal Context\ncashier + device + shift + Site" as Context
}

component "Central PMS\npayment finality + ExitAuthorization authority" as Central
component "Discount Workflow\npolicy resolution" as Discount
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider outcome verification" as POA
component "Resolved Site POS Server\nSales Invoice authority" as POS
component "Operator Console\ngovernance and review" as Console
component "Gate / Exit\nconsume authorization" as Gate

Cashier --> CashierMode : assisted lookup / payment
Parker --> CashierMode : customer interaction
Supervisor --> ContinuityMode : activation context where approved
CashierMode --> Context : capture context
ContinuityMode --> Context : capture restricted context

CashierMode --> Central : submit assisted workflow
CashierMode --> Discount : submit statutory inputs
ContinuityMode --> Central : restricted degraded workflow
Central --> POA : payment coordination
Central --> POS : fiscal routing after finality
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization if eligible
Console --> Central : review / governance
Console --> Discount : evidence review context

note bottom of CashierMode
Captures inputs and displays backend status.
Does not approve entitlement or mutate payable basis directly.
end note

note bottom of ContinuityMode
Disabled by default.
No silent fallback to degraded mode.
end note

note right of POS
Terminal is not an independent POS or fiscal authority.
end note
@enduml
